OL,3,APolice had councillor's fingerprints on
OL,4,Ahate mail - but dropped case
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice had fingerprint evidence linking
OL,7,Fa high-profile councillor to a poison
OL,8,Fpen letter up to 12 months before he
OL,9,Fwent on to target another politician in
OL,10,Fa "persistent and wicked" hate mail
OL,11,Fcampaign.
OL,13,FWell-known Liverpool anti-poverty
OL,14,Fcampaigner Gerard Woodhouse, 63, was
OL,15,Fgiven a community order last year for
OL,16,Fharassing ex-Lord Mayor Christine Banks
OL,17,F` who he had known for 50 years ` with
OL,18,Fanonymous letters and cards in the post
OL,19,Fbetween 2023 and 2025.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
