OL,3,APolice had councillor's fingerprints on
OL,4,Ahate mail - but dropped case
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the BBC has learned that although
OL,7,Fan investigation that pre-dated his
OL,8,Fhate campaign against Labour colleague
OL,9,FBanks yielded fingerprint evidence from
OL,10,Fa letter sent to a housing association
OL,11,Fboss, the inquiry was stood down
OL,12,Fbecause officers were "unable to
OL,13,Festablish contact" with the alleged
OL,14,Fvictim after she left her job.
OL,16,FDespite reopening the case earlier this
OL,17,Fyear, police have now had to drop it
OL,18,Fbecause the time limit for prosecuting
OL,19,Fharassment allegations has expired.
